  "goodToKnow": "Die Haftstrafe is a prison sentence (official term: die Freiheitsstrafe): eine Haftstrafe verbüßen (to serve a sentence). Sentences of up to two years can be suspended (zur Bewährung ausgesetzt). A life sentence (lebenslang) in Germany usually means a parole review after 15 years. Most offences are punished with fines (Geldstrafen) instead. Plural: die Haftstrafen."
